  "feesApplyText": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Fees for Assured Periodic Tenancy (APT)</strong></span></p><br /><p><strong>Before You Move In</strong></p><br /><strong>Holding Deposit: </strong>Equivalent to one week\u2019s rent. This deposit holds the property while you complete reference checks and sign the tenancy agreement. If you cancel, provide false information, or don\u2019t complete the agreement, this deposit is not refunded.<br /><p><strong>Security Deposit:</strong></p><br /><p><strong>For rent under \u00a350,000 per year:</strong> Five weeks\u2019 rent. This is held in a government-backed scheme and will be returned if there are no damages or unpaid rent.\u00a0<br /><strong>For rent between \u00a350,000 and \u00a3100,000 per year:</strong> Six weeks\u2019 rent, also held in a government-backed scheme.</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Non-Assured Periodic Tenancy (Non-AST)</strong></span></p><br /><p><strong>Before You Move In:</strong></p><br /><p><strong></strong><strong>Holding Deposit: </strong>Equivalent to two weeks of rent. This deposit holds the property while you complete reference checks and sign the tenancy agreement. If you cancel, provide false information, or don\u2019t complete the agreement, this deposit is not refunded.</p><br /><p><strong>Tenancy Agreement Fee:</strong> \u00a3288 (inc. VAT) for preparing the rental agreement.</p><br /><p><strong>Reference Fee: </strong>\u00a360 (inc. VAT) per person for checking your references.</p><br /><p><strong>Occupant Check Fee: </strong>\u00a330 (inc. VAT) per adult living with you, to confirm they have the legal right to rent.</p><br /><p><strong>Guarantor Fee:</strong> \u00a360 (inc. VAT) per guarantor, if one is needed to support your tenancy.</p><br /><p><strong>Security Deposit: </strong>Six weeks\u2019 rent, held in our client account, and returned if there are no issues at the end of the tenancy\u00a0</p><br /><p><strong>Stamp Duty: </strong>Applies if your rent is over \u00a3250,000 per year. Please seek independent advice.</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>Crown Home Buying and Letting Ltd is a member of Propertymark and is covered by the Propertymark Client Money Protection (CMP) Scheme. We adhere to the <a href=\" \" rel=\"nofollow\">Propertymark Conduct and Membership Rules</a> and are also a member of the <a href=\" \" rel=\"nofollow\">Property Redress Scheme (PRS)</a></p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><br />",
